<title>CANADA: Canadian National trains delayed by blizzard - CN.</title>
<headline>Canadian National trains delayed by blizzard - CN.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian National Railway Co said on Monday its trains were running in snow bound British Columbia but were delayed.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a once in a lifetime snowstorm. There have been disruptions but the trains are running and we're trying to bring things back to normal,&quot; CN spokesman Jim Feeny said in an interview from Edmonton.</p>
<p>The blizzard dumped 34 cms (13.5 inches) of snow on Vancouver in the 24-hour period ended Sunday evening.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
